torname{cos}⁡(-8\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-8\\theta )]=2[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8\\theta )-\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(8\\theta )].\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186240799 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "59e45f0d-0ea0-5ada-83df-3be6a2220834" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{5\\theta }{3})-\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{5\\theta }{3})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186238830} {:answer/id #uuid "75466386-79e9-5787-af85-65507c3840a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(15\\theta )-\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(15\\theta )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239069} {:answer/id #uuid "8a034375-8e42-535c-89c0-d703456a21c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "15[\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta ]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239256} {:answer/id #uuid "97ea0f12-cf93-540c-b3f1-caaa73c29a2f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{3\\theta }{5})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{3\\theta }{5})" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239373} {:answer/id #uuid "ae6e2bb2-de41-55e9-97b2-d3f0712a3fca" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5\\theta )]" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239571}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "75466386-79e9-5787-af85-65507c3840a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(15\\theta )-\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(15\\theta )" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186239069} :answer-field/id #uuid "9d609b2b-df3f-5da4-a239-babda8a7bd7e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186240607}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "d84899af-756a-5c8a-9b35-3122383135e7" :question/math-academy-id "q-104123" :question/problem "Simplify the expression $\\frac{1}{[\\operatorname{cos}⁡5\\theta +\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡5\\theta ]^{3}}.$" :question/worked-solution "First, note that\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{[\\operatorname{cos}⁡5\\theta +\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡5\\theta ]^{3}}=[\\operatorname{cos}⁡5\\theta +\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡5\\theta ]^{-3}.\n$$\n\nDe Moivre's Theorem states that\n\n$$\n[\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\phi +\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\phi ]^{n}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\phi )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(n\\phi ).\n$$\n\nIn our expression, we have $n=-3$ and $\\phi =5\\theta .$ Substituting in these values, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{[\\operatorname{cos}⁡5\\theta +\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡5\\theta ]^{3}} & =[\\operatorname{cos}⁡5\\theta +\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡5\\theta ]^{-3} \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(5(-3)\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(5(-3)\\theta ) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-15\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-15\\theta ).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, using the fact that $\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-\\phi )=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\phi )$ and $\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-\\phi )=-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\phi )$ for any input $\\phi ,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\operatorname{cos}⁡(-15\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(-15\\theta )=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(15\\theta )-\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(15\\theta ).\n$$"}]
